m{Form}_{L&#39;}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L&#39;}\">\\(t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L&#39;}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L&#39;}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L&#39;}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L&#39;,k}\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L&#39;,k}\\)</span>。项及公式构造见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c40994941c97c4da\" href=\"?note=c40994941c97c4da\" title=\"17-df-term\">17-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}:\\mathrm{Form}_{L&#39;}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_{L&#39;})\">\\(\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}:\\mathrm{Form}_{L&#39;}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_{L&#39;})\\)</span> 由下式结构递归定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(t_0=t_1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(R(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1}))&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(\\neg\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha\\to\\beta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha)\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(\\beta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(\\forall x\\,\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\}\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(t_0=t_1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(R(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1}))&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(\\neg\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha\\to\\beta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha)\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(\\beta),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(\\forall x\\,\\alpha)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\}\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_{L&#39;}(\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条从原 Skolem 文件内已经写出的递归抽出，使“约束变量”成为可直接引用的本册接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"c40994941c97c4da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"c40994941c97c4da","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L'\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L'}$，$t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L'}$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L'}$，$R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L',k}$。项及公式构造见 [[17-df-term]]、[[17-df-formula]]。$\\mathrm{BV}_{L'}:\\mathrm{Form}_{L'}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_{L'})$ 由下式结构递归定义。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L'\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L'}$，$t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L'}$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L'}$，$R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L',k}$。项及公式构造见 [[17-df-term]]、[[17-df-formula]]。$\\mathrm{BV}_{L'}:\\mathrm{Form}_{L'}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_{L'})$ 由下式结构递归定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"L'\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"t_i\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L'}","display":false},{"tex":"